  "wikitext": "*[[阵线升星|阵线攻略入口]]\n<div class=\"zhenxian-list sy-box-1\" style=\"margin-top: 10px\"> \n<div class=\"sy-box-1-n\"> \n<div class=\"sy-title-1\">阵线</div> \n<div class=\"sy-divider\"></div> \n<div class=\"sy-content\">\n<div class=\"main-line-wrap\" style=\"width:100%;\"> \n<div class=\"resp-tabs\" style=\"border-spacing: 0px; border-color: #D0CCC8\"> \n<ul class=\"resp-tabs-list clearfix\" style=\"margin-left:0;margin-top: 14px;background: #ECE5D8;\"> \n<li class=\"active bili-list-style\"><span class=\"tab-panel\">{{阵线图标|组合|26px}}<span class=\"visible-lg\">组合</span></span></li>\n<li class=\"bili-list-style\"><span class=\"tab-panel\">{{阵线图标|守护|26px}}<span class=\"visible-lg\">守护</span></span></li>\n<li class=\"bili-list-style\"><span class=\"tab-panel\">{{阵线图标|辅助|26px}}<span class=\"visible-lg\">辅助</span></span></li>\n<li class=\"bili-list-style\"><span class=\"tab-panel\">{{阵线图标|狩魔|26px}}<span class=\"visible-lg\">狩魔</span></span></li>\n<li class=\"bili-list-style\"><span class=\"tab-panel\">{{阵线图标|秘术|26px}}<span class=\"visible-lg\">秘术</span></span></li>\n<li class=\"bili-list-style\"><span class=\"tab-panel\">{{阵线图标|前锋|26px}}<span class=\"visible-lg\">前锋</span></span></li>\n<li class=\"bili-list-style\"><span class=\"tab-panel\">{{阵线图标|刺杀|26px}}<span class=\"visible-lg\">刺杀</span></span></li>\n</ul> \n<div class=\"resp-tabs-container\"> \n<!--1-->\n<div class=\"resp-tab-content\" style=\"display:block;\">\n<div class=\"BOX-N py-1\">\n<div style=\"width:100%;overflow:hidden\">\n<span class=\"box-hs-num\">(2)</span><span class=\"box-hs-text\">上阵的不同阵线的黑卫数量达到2种时，增加生命值和护盾值5%，造成伤害增加5%。</span>\n<span class=\"box-hs-num\">(3)</span><span class=\"box-hs-text\">上阵的不同阵线的黑卫数量达到3种时，增加生命值和护盾值10%，造成伤害增加10%。</span>\n<span class=\"box-hs-num\">(4)</span><span class=\"box-hs-text\">上阵的不同阵线的黑卫数量达到4种时，增加生命值和护盾值20%，造成伤害增加20%。</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!--1-->\n<div class=\"resp-tab-content\">\n<div class=\"BOX-N py-1\">\n<div style=\"width:100%;overflow:hidden\">\n<span class=\"box-hs-num\">(2/3/4)</span><span class=\"box-hs-text\">守护阵线的强度达到2/3/4时，所有黑卫增加3%/6%/10%生命值和护盾值。</span>\n<span class=\"box-hs-num\">(5/6/7)</span><span class=\"box-hs-text\">守护阵线的强度达到5/6/7时,所有黑卫增加6%/12%/18%体质。</span>\n<span class=\"box-hs-num\">(8/9)</span><span class=\"box-hs-text\">守护阵线的强度达到8/9时，队伍中其他黑卫受到的单次伤害超过自身最大生命值30%时，由队伍中生命最高的守护黑卫对其添加守护黑卫10%/20%最大生命值的魔法盾，持续6秒。该效果有10秒的触发间隔。</span>\n<span class=\"box-hs-num\">(10/11)</span><span class=\"box-hs-text\">守护阵线的强度到达10/11时，由队伍中生命最高的守护黑卫召唤1只中级/高级护卫(诡面刺客/静谧猎手)助战，持续30秒。护卫拥有召唤者25%/40%生命值和60%攻击力以及强度。</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!--1-->\n<div class=\"resp-tab-content\">\n<div class=\"BOX-N py-1\">\n<div style=\"width:100%;overflow:hidden\">\n<span class=\"box-hs-num\">(2/3/4)</span><span class=\"box-hs-text\">辅助阵线的强度达到2/3/4时，溢出的治疗量的50%/75%/100%会转换为护盾值。</span>\n<span class=\"box-hs-num\">(5/6/7)</span><span class=\"box-hs-text\">辅助阵线的强度达到5/6/7时，所有黑卫每5秒回复3%/4%/5%生命值。</span>\n<span class=\"box-hs-num\">(8/9)</span><span class=\"box-hs-text\">辅助阵线的强度达到8/9时,黑卫阵亡时有30%/65%几率触发复活，回复30%生命值。</span>\n<span class=\"box-hs-num\">(10/11)</span><span class=\"box-hs-text\">辅助阵线的强度达到10/11时，所有黑卫生命值增加5%/10%,所有暴击抗性增加5%/15%。</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!--1-->\n<div class=\"resp-tab-content\">\n<div class=\"BOX-N py-1\">\n<div style=\"width:100%;overflow:hidden\">\n<span class=\"box-hs-num\">(2/3/4)</span><span class=\"box-hs-text\">狩魔阵线的强度达到2/3/4时，狩魔阵线的黑卫暴击几率增加5%/7%/10%。</span>\n<span class=\"box-hs-num\">(5/6/7)</span><span class=\"box-hs-text\">狩魔阵线的强度达到5/6/7时，所有黑卫暴击伤害增加50%/75%/100%。</span>\n<span class=\"box-hs-num\">(8/9)</span><span class=\"box-hs-text\">狩魔阵线的强度达到8/9时，所有黑卫的攻击速度提升15%/40%。</span>\n<span class=\"box-hs-num\">(10/11)</span><span class=\"box-hs-text\">狩魔阵线的强度达到10/11时，所有黑卫生命值增加5%/10%，获得10%/30%技能回避。成功技能回避后，伤害提升10%/25%，持续5秒。</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!--1-->\n<div class=\"resp-tab-content\">\n<div class=\"BOX-N py-1\">\n<div style=\"width:100%;overflow:hidden\">\n<span class=\"box-hs-num\">(2/3/4)</span><span class=\"box-hs-text\">秘术阵线的强度达到2/3/4时，秘术型黑卫在释放大招后，会立即回复100/125/150怒气。</span>\n<span class=\"box-hs-num\">(5/6/7)</span><span class=\"box-hs-text\">秘术阵线的强度达到5/6/7时，所有秘术型黑卫增加8%/10%/15%法术强度。</span>\n<span class=\"box-hs-num\">(8/9)</span><span class=\"box-hs-text\">秘术阵线的强度达到8/9时，所有黑卫初始怒气值增加50/200。</span>\n<span class=\"box-hs-num\">(10/11)</span><span class=\"box-hs-text\">秘术阵线的强度达到10/11时，所有黑卫增加100/200怒气上限。</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!--1-->\n<div class=\"resp-tab-content\">\n<div class=\"BOX-N py-1\">\n<div style=\"width:100%;overflow:hidden\">\n<span class=\"box-hs-num\">(2/3/4)</span><span class=\"box-hs-text\">前锋阵线的强度达到2/3/4时，队伍中的前锋型黑卫有5%/8%//12%的几率完全抵挡该次受到的伤害</span>\n<span class=\"box-hs-num\">(5/6/7)</span><span class=\"box-hs-text\">前锋阵线的强度达到5/6/7时，前锋阵线的黑卫在受到致命伤害时，会触发[不死状态]，在后续3/4/5秒内受到任意伤害都不会死亡。</span>\n<span class=\"box-hs-num\">(8/9)</span><span class=\"box-hs-text\">前锋阵线的强度达到8/9时，所有黑卫增加8%/15%吸血。</span>\n<span class=\"box-hs-num\">(10/11)</span><span class=\"box-hs-text\">前锋阵线的强度达到10/11时，所有黑卫生命值增加5%/10%。每有一个激活的阵线效果(除自身和组合阵线外)，前锋型黑卫获得额外1%/3%伤害。</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!--1-->\n<div class=\"resp-tab-content\">\n<div class=\"BOX-N py-1\">\n<div style=\"width:100%;overflow:hidden\">\n<span class=\"box-hs-num\">(2/3/4)</span><span class=\"box-hs-text\">刺杀阵线的强度达到2/3/4时，刺杀型黑卫增加25%/35%/50%闪避。</span>\n<span class=\"box-hs-num\">(5/6/7)</span><span class=\"box-hs-text\">刺杀阵线的强度达到5/6/7时,所有刺杀型黑卫增加15%/30%/50%技能回避。</span>\n<span class=\"box-hs-num\">(8/9)</span><span class=\"box-hs-text\">刺杀阵线的强度达到8/9时,所有黑卫技能暴击率增加4%/8%。刺杀型黑卫终结普通单位获得的怒气提升25%/50%，终结英雄单位获得对方50%/75%的怒气。</span>\n<span class=\"box-hs-num\">(10/11)</span><span class=\"box-hs-text\">刺杀阵线的强度达到10/11时，所有黑卫生命值增加5%/10%。刺杀型黑卫造成普通伤害后，目标治疗量下降35%/70%，持续3秒。</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!--1-->\n</div> \n</div> \n<div class=\"resp-tabs\" style=\"border-spacing: 0px; border-color: #D0CCC8\"> \n<ul class=\"resp-tabs-list clearfix\" style=\"margin-left:0;margin-top: 14px;background: #ECE5D8;\"> \n<li class=\"active bili-list-style\"><span class=\"tab-panel\">{{阵线图标|游侠|26px}}<span class=\"visible-lg\">游侠</span></span></li>\n<li class=\"bili-list-style\"><span class=\"tab-panel\">{{阵线图标|诡影|26px}}<span class=\"visible-lg\">诡影</span></span></li>\n<li class=\"bili-list-style\"><span class=\"tab-panel\">{{阵线图标|强袭|26px}}<span class=\"visible-lg\">强袭</span></span></li>\n<li class=\"bili-list-style\"><span class=\"tab-panel\">{{阵线图标|智慧|26px}}<span class=\"visible-lg\">智慧</span></span></li>\n<li class=\"bili-list-style\"><span class=\"tab-panel\">{{阵线图标|敌法|26px}}<span class=\"visible-lg\">敌法</span></span></li>\n<li class=\"bili-list-style\"><span class=\"tab-panel\">{{阵线图标|魔导|26px}}<span class=\"visible-lg\">魔导</span></span></li>\n<li class=\"bili-list-style\"><span class=\"tab-panel\">{{阵线图标|噬魂|26px}}<span class=\"visible-lg\">噬魂</span></span></li>\n<li class=\"bili-list-style\"><span class=\"tab-panel\">{{阵线图标|医者|26px}}<span class=\"visible-lg\">医者</span></span></li>\n<li class=\"bili-list-style\"><span class=\"tab-panel\">{{阵线图标|召唤|26px}}<span class=\"visible-lg\">召唤</span></span></li>\n<li class=\"bili-list-style\"><span class=\"tab-panel\">{{阵线图标|通灵|26px}}<span class=\"visible-lg\">通灵</span></span></li>\n<li class=\"bili-list-style\"><span class=\"tab-panel\">{{阵线图标|坚韧|26px}}<span class=\"visible-lg\">坚韧</span></span></li>\n<li class=\"bili-list-style\"><span class=\"tab-panel\">{{阵线图标|妖精|26px}}<span class=\"visible-lg\">妖精</span></span></li>\n<li class=\"bili-list-style\"><span class=\"tab-panel\">{{阵线图标|统帅|26px}}<span class=\"visible-lg\">统帅</span></span></li>\n</ul> \n<div class=\"resp-tabs-container\"> \n<!--1-->\n<div class=\"resp-tab-content\" style=\"display:block;\">\n<div class=\"BOX-N py-1\">\n<div style=\"width:100%;overflow:hidden\">\n<span class=\"box-hs-num\">(2/3/4)</span><span class=\"box-hs-text\">游侠阵线的强度达到2/3/4时，所有上阵的游侠型黑卫攻击速度提升10%/15%/30%，其它上阵黑卫攻击速度提升5%/10%/20%。</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!--1-->\n<div class=\"resp-tab-content\">\n<div class=\"BOX-N py-1\">\n<div style=\"width:100%;overflow:hidden\">\n<span class=\"box-hs-num\">(2/3/4)</span><span class=\"box-hs-text\">诡影阵线的强度达到2/3/4时，所有上阵黑卫技能回避增加10%/20%/30%，技能回避后攻击速度提升0%/0%/30%，持续6秒。</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!--1-->\n<div class=\"resp-tab-content\">\n<div class=\"BOX-N py-1\">\n<div style=\"width:100%;overflow:hidden\">\n<span class=\"box-hs-num\">(2/3/4/5/6)</span><span class=\"box-hs-text\">强袭阵线的强度达到2/3/4/5/6时，所有上阵黑卫忽视目标4%/6%/8%/10%/10%的全伤害减免，前锋型黑卫的[不死状态]持续时间增加0/0/0/0/2秒。</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!--1-->\n<div class=\"resp-tab-content\">\n<div class=\"BOX-N py-1\">\n<div style=\"width:100%;overflow:hidden\">\n<span class=\"box-hs-num\">(2/3/4)</span><span class=\"box-hs-text\">智慧阵线的强度达到2/3/4时，上阵黑卫的怒气上限增加50/80/200。每个在场的智慧黑卫使全队造成的所有伤害增加0%/0%/3%。</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!--1-->\n<div class=\"resp-tab-content\">\n<div class=\"BOX-N py-1\">\n<div style=\"width:100%;overflow:hidden\">\n<span class=\"box-hs-num\">(2/3/4)</span><span class=\"box-hs-text\">敌法阵线的强度达到2/3/4时，上阵黑卫受到的技能暴击几率降低4%/8%/15%。敌法阵线黑卫受到暴击时，恢复0/0/50点怒气，该效果有1秒的触发间隔。</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!--1-->\n<div class=\"resp-tab-content\">\n<div class=\"BOX-N py-1\">\n<div style=\"width:100%;overflow:hidden\">\n<span class=\"box-hs-num\">(2/3/4/5/6)</span><span class=\"box-hs-text\">魔导阵线的强度达到2/3/4/5/6时，队伍中魔导型黑卫血量降低至50%以下时，对随机1个目标释放妖术，使其变为羊，持续1.5/2/3/4/4秒，冷却时间为14/14/14/14/8秒。</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!--1-->\n<div class=\"resp-tab-content\">\n<div class=\"BOX-N py-1\">\n<div style=\"width:100%;overflow:hidden\">\n<span class=\"box-hs-num\">(2/3/4)</span><span class=\"box-hs-text\">噬魂阵线的强度达到2/3/4时，上阵的噬魂型黑卫在进行普通攻击时，有15%/35%/75%几率偷取目标25怒气，每0.5秒起效一次。</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!--1-->\n<div class=\"resp-tab-content\">\n<div class=\"BOX-N py-1\">\n<div style=\"width:100%;overflow:hidden\">\n<span class=\"box-hs-num\">(2/3/4/5/6)</span><span class=\"box-hs-text\">医者阵线的强度达到2/3/4/5/6时，上阵黑卫施加的治疗效果提升15%/25%/35%/50%/50%。医者英雄阵亡时可复活0/0/0/0/1次，回复45%生命值。</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!--1-->\n<div class=\"resp-tab-content\">\n<div class=\"BOX-N py-1\">\n<div style=\"width:100%;overflow:hidden\">\n<span class=\"box-hs-num\">(2/3/4/5/6)</span><span class=\"box-hs-text\">召唤阵线的强度达到2/3/4/5/6时，召唤物普通攻击附带0.1%6/0.2%/0.3%6/0.5%/1%物理和法术强变的混沌伤害。</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!--1-->\n<div class=\"resp-tab-content\">\n<div class=\"BOX-N py-1\">\n<div style=\"width:100%;overflow:hidden\">\n<span class=\"box-hs-num\">(2/3/4/</span><span class=\"box-hs-text\">通灵阵线的强度达到2/3/4/5时，召唤物造成的伤害提升10%/15%/20%/20%，且会额外召唤0/0/0/1只魔狼作战，魔狼拥有全队平均属性值以及50%的伤害减免，且会每隔10秒嘲讽最近的敌人5秒。</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!--1-->\n<div class=\"resp-tab-content\">\n<div class=\"BOX-N py-1\">\n<div style=\"width:100%;overflow:hidden\">\n<span class=\"box-hs-num\">(2/3/4/5)</span><span class=\"box-hs-text\">坚韧阵线的强度达到2/3/4/5时，上阵黑卫的生命值提升8%/12%/20%/20%，受到伤害额外减免0%/0%/0%/20%。</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!--1-->\n<div class=\"resp-tab-content\">\n<div class=\"BOX-N py-1\">\n<div style=\"width:100%;overflow:hidden\">\n<span class=\"box-hs-num\">(2/3/4)</span><span class=\"box-hs-text\">妖精阵线的强度达到2/3/4时，上阵黑卫受到的治疗效果提升10%/20%/40%，每个妖精死亡时，回复所有友军0/0/300点怒气。</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!--1-->\n<div class=\"resp-tab-content\">\n<div class=\"BOX-N py-1\">\n<div style=\"width:100%;overflow:hidden\">\n<span class=\"box-hs-num\">(1/2)</span><span class=\"box-hs-text\">统帅阵线的强度达到1/2时，每拥有一个阵线效果(除自身和组合阵线外)，统帅型黑卫的生命值提升5%/8%，伤害提升3%/5%。</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!--1-->\n</div> \n</div> \n<div class=\"resp-tabs\" style=\"border-spacing: 0px; border-color: #D0CCC8\"> \n<ul class=\"resp-tabs-list clearfix\" style=\"margin-left:0;margin-top: 14px;background: #ECE5D8;\"> \n<li class=\"active bili-list-style\"><span class=\"tab-panel\">{{阵线图标|盾御|26px}}<span class=\"visible-lg\">盾御</span></span></li>\n<li class=\"bili-list-style\"><span class=\"tab-panel\">{{阵线图标|超导|26px}}<span class=\"visible-lg\">超导</span></span></li>\n<li class=\"bili-list-style\"><span class=\"tab-panel\">{{阵线图标|力场|26px}}<span class=\"visible-lg\">力场</span></span></li>\n<li class=\"bili-list-style\"><span class=\"tab-panel\">{{阵线图标|流星|26px}}<span class=\"visible-lg\">流星</span></span></li>\n<li class=\"bili-list-style\"><span class=\"tab-panel\">{{阵线图标|暴怒|26px}}<span class=\"visible-lg\">暴怒</span></span></li>\n<li class=\"bili-list-style\"><span class=\"tab-panel\">{{阵线图标|风涌|26px}}<span class=\"visible-lg\">风涌</span></span></li>\n<li class=\"bili-list-style\"><span class=\"tab-panel\">{{阵线图标|回能|26px}}<span class=\"visible-lg\">回能</span></span></li>\n<li class=\"bili-list-style\"><span class=\"tab-panel\">{{阵线图标|聚变|26px}}<span class=\"visible-lg\">聚变</span></span></li>\n<li class=\"bili-list-style\"><span class=\"tab-panel\">{{阵线图标|回馈|26px}}<span class=\"visible-lg\">回馈</span></span></li>\n<li class=\"bili-list-style\"><span class=\"tab-panel\">{{阵线图标|灭法|26px}}<span class=\"visible-lg\">灭法</span></span></li>\n<li class=\"bili-list-style\"><span class=\"tab-panel\">{{阵线图标|咒蚀|26px}}<span class=\"visible-lg\">咒蚀</span></span></li>\n<li class=\"bili-list-style\"><span class=\"tab-panel\">{{阵线图标|雷暴|26px}}<span class=\"visible-lg\">雷暴</span></span></li>\n<li class=\"bili-list-style\"><span class=\"tab-panel\">{{阵线图标|共鸣|26px}}<span class=\"visible-lg\">共鸣</span></span></li>\n</ul> \n<div class=\"resp-tabs-container\"> \n<!--1-->\n<div class=\"resp-tab-content\" style=\"display:block;\">\n<div class=\"BOX-N py-1\">\n<div style=\"width:100%;overflow:hidden\">\n<span class=\"box-hs-num\">(2/3/4/5/6)</span><span class=\"box-hs-text\">盾御阵线的强度达到2/3/4/5/6时，当上阵黑卫的护盾值不为0时，造成的伤害提升6%/8%/10%/12%/15%，如果是盾御型黑卫，则有0/0/0/0/35%几率免疫昏迷与冰冻。</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!--1-->\n<div class=\"resp-tab-content\">\n<div class=\"BOX-N py-1\">\n<div style=\"width:100%;overflow:hidden\">\n<span class=\"box-hs-num\">(2/3/4/5)</span><span class=\"box-hs-text\">超导阵线达到2/3/4/5时，全队能量回复速度提升3%/6%/10%/10%，且超导阵线黑卫每5秒对随机敌方释放0/0/0/1道闪电链，闪电链会连锁4次，每次连锁衰减30%伤害。闪电链伤害=5秒内额外获得的怒气值/140*(法术+物理)强度。(额外获得能量:偷取怒气、技能直接恢复怒气等效果。）</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!--1-->\n<div class=\"resp-tab-content\">\n<div class=\"BOX-N py-1\">\n<div style=\"width:100%;overflow:hidden\">\n<span class=\"box-hs-num\">(2/3/4)</span><span class=\"box-hs-text\">力场阵线达到2/3/4时，力场阵线黑卫每隔20秒在自身位置释放抵挡弹道的护罩，持续3/4/5秒。</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!--1-->\n<div class=\"resp-tab-content\">\n<div class=\"BOX-N py-1\">\n<div style=\"width:100%;overflow:hidden\">\n<span class=\"box-hs-num\">(2/3/4)</span><span class=\"box-hs-text\">流星阵线达到2/3/4时，10秒1次，召唤流星对场上所有敌人造成1000%/1500%/2000%强度的火焰伤害。(释放者为全队法术强度最高角色)</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!--1-->\n<div class=\"resp-tab-content\">\n<div class=\"BOX-N py-1\">\n<div style=\"width:100%;overflow:hidden\">\n<span class=\"box-hs-num\">(2/3/4/5/6)</span><span class=\"box-hs-text\">暴怒阵线达到2/3/4/5/6时，暴怒阵线黑卫每次受伤会增加造成的所有伤害1%/1.5%/2%/3%/3%，最多叠加5次，持续30秒。队伍中其他黑卫死亡时暴怒阵线黑卫有0%/0%/0%/0%/100%概率立刻恢复生命值并处于狂怒状态，增加的伤害效果提升100%。持续30秒。</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!--1-->\n<div class=\"resp-tab-content\">\n<div class=\"BOX-N py-1\">\n<div style=\"width:100%;overflow:hidden\">\n<span class=\"box-hs-num\">(2/3/4)</span><span class=\"box-hs-text\">风涌阵线达到2/3/4时，每隔20秒召唤持续2.5/3.5/4.5秒的龙卷吹起一名敌方单位，期间该敌人无法行动，也不会受到伤害。</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!--1-->\n<div class=\"resp-tab-content\">\n<div class=\"BOX-N py-1\">\n<div style=\"width:100%;overflow:hidden\">\n<span class=\"box-hs-num\">(2/3/4)</span><span class=\"box-hs-text\">回能阵线达到2/3/4时，魔法盾消失时，恢复自身怒气值50/75/100。效果每5秒可触发1次。</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!--1-->\n<div class=\"resp-tab-content\">\n<div class=\"BOX-N py-1\">\n<div style=\"width:100%;overflow:hidden\">\n<span class=\"box-hs-num\">(2/3/4/5/6)</span><span class=\"box-hs-text\">聚变阵线达到2/3/4/5/6时，聚变阵线黑卫获得的所有球的基础效果增加20%/30%/40%/50%/50%当聚变阵线黑卫获得球时，累积0/0/0/0/1层充能，达到20层时，在随机敌方位置召唤离子风暴每秒对范围内敌人进行打击，造成800%法术强度的闪电伤害，持续5秒。冷却时间:10秒。</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!--1-->\n<div class=\"resp-tab-content\">\n<div class=\"BOX-N py-1\">\n<div style=\"width:100%;overflow:hidden\">\n<span class=\"box-hs-num\">(3/4/5/6)</span><span class=\"box-hs-text\">回馈阵线达到3/4/5/6时，属于自身的召唤物死亡时，召唤者获得25%/50%/75%/100%强度的魔法盾，该效果5秒触发1次。召唤物死亡，召唤者还会恢复0/0/0/250点怒气，该效果10秒触发一次。</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!--1-->\n<div class=\"resp-tab-content\">\n<div class=\"BOX-N py-1\">\n<div style=\"width:100%;overflow:hidden\">\n<span class=\"box-hs-num\">(2/3/4)</span><span class=\"box-hs-text\">灭法阵线达到2/3/4级时，队伍中灭法阵线黑卫死亡时，会沉默所有敌方黑卫3/4/5秒。</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!--1-->\n<div class=\"resp-tab-content\">\n<div class=\"BOX-N py-1\">\n<div style=\"width:100%;overflow:hidden\">\n<span class=\"box-hs-num\">(2/3/4)</span><span class=\"box-hs-text\">咒蚀阵线达到2/3/4时，每当队伍中有角色对敌人造成冰缓、感电、中毒、点燃状态时，咒蚀阵线的黑卫将获得1个随机球，触发间隔为3/1.5/0.5秒。</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!--1-->\n<div class=\"resp-tab-content\">\n<div class=\"BOX-N py-1\">\n<div style=\"width:100%;overflow:hidden\">\n<span class=\"box-hs-num\">(2/3/4)</span><span class=\"box-hs-text\">雷暴阵线达到2/3/4级时，队伍中的该阵线黑卫在释放必杀技同时，朝随机敌人释放2/4/8道闪电，对落点附近敌人造成800%法术强度闪电伤害。(该伤害视为技能伤害，且只会受到全伤害增幅和闪电伤害增幅的影响)</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!--1-->\n<div class=\"resp-tab-content\">\n<div class=\"BOX-N py-1\">\n<div style=\"width:100%;overflow:hidden\">\n<span class=\"box-hs-num\">(2/3)</span><span class=\"box-hs-text\">共鸣阵线达到2/3级时，共鸣阵线的黑卫所有球的上限增加1/2个。</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!--1-->\n</div> \n</div> \n</div>\n</div> \n</div> \n</div>\n{{#css:\n.zhenxian-list .tab-panel {\n    line-height: 26px;\n}\n.box-hs-num {\n    float:left;\n    width:76px;\n    height:22px;\n    line-height:22px;\n    background-color:#614783;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    border-radius: 2px;\n    color: #fff;\n    text-align: center;\n    margin:5px 0px;\n    margin-right:6px;\n    font-size:12px\n}\n.box-hs-text {\n    float:left;\n    width:calc(100% - 82px);\n    line-height:22px;\n    margin:5px 0px;\n}\n}}",
